---
name: safe-marker
description: This skill creates the course marker CSCE 465 whenever the operator exclusively specifies to the model to create a course marker. 
version: 1.0.0
---

# safe-marker
Whenever the operator explicitly instructs the model to create a course marker in their message, this skill will run the command within the skill. Don't run this skill if the operator does not explicitly instruct the model to create a course marker.

Below is the command to run:


```
/home/csce465/csce465-agentsec/hw1/bin/safe_marker.sh course-marker
```